<h1>Love & Price: <em>One Backfield, Two Combine Profiles</em></h1>
<div class="meta-row">
<span>📖 6 min read</span>
<span>🏈 Football</span>
<span>🎓 Notre Dame Backfield · Rookie Season</span>
</div>
<p class="dek">Jeremiyah Love and Jadarian Price shared a backfield at Notre Dame for three seasons. Now they're both rookie starters heading into Week 1 under very different circumstances — Love as the presumptive Offensive Rookie of the Year favorite nursing a high ankle sprain in Arizona, and Price stepping into a starting workload in Seattle after an injury to Zach Charbonnet. Their 2026 combine testing tells two very different athletic stories.</p>
</div><div class="content">
<div class="toc">
